{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "myanimalog-user-service-collection",
    "name": "MyAnimaLog User Service",
    "description": "Coleccion generada con postman/build-collection.js — NO editar el .json a mano, editar este script y regenerar.\n\nOrden recomendado: 00 (login/registro) -> 01 (registro) -> 02/03 (si aplica) -> 04 (perfil) -> 05 (contexto de clinica, requiere veterinaryId real) -> 06 (internos, requiere internal_api_key).\n\nToken por carpeta: 00-03 sin auth (publicas); 04-05 Bearer {{access_token}} (05 tambien acepta {{clinic_token}}); 06 header X-Internal-Api-Key, sin Bearer.\n\nVer postman/README.md para detalle de variables y como regenerar/verificar esta coleccion.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Iniciar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/auth/local",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "local"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login local. Publico (sin token). Responde `{token, refreshToken, expiresIn}`.\n\nErrores: 401 credenciales invalidas, 403 `EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"luis.santiago@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function decodeJwtId(token) {",
                  "    try {",
                  "        const payload = JSON.parse(atob(token.split('.')[1]));",
                  "        return payload.id;",
                  "    } catch (e) { return undefined; }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
                  "const id = decodeJwtId(body.token);",
                  "if (id) pm.environment.set('user_id', id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {},
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"<jwt>\",\n  \"refreshToken\": \"<refresh-token>\",\n  \"expiresIn\": 3600\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Iniciar sesión con Google",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/auth/google",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "google"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login/registro automatico via ID Token de Google. Publico. Responde `{token, refreshToken, expiresIn}`.\n\nErrores: 401 `InvalidTokenException` si el idToken es invalido o falta.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"idToken\": \"<id-token-de-google>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function decodeJwtId(token) {",
                  "    try {",
                  "        const payload = JSON.parse(atob(token.split('.')[1]));",
                  "        return payload.id;",
                  "    } catch (e) { return undefined; }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
                  "const id = decodeJwtId(body.token);",
                  "if (id) pm.environment.set('user_id', id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Refrescar token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rota el refresh token y emite un access token nuevo (revalida membresia si era de contexto clinica). Publico (valida el refresh token, no un JWT).\n\nErrores: 401 token invalido/expirado/reutilizado, 401 `VETERINARY_MEMBERSHIP_REVOKED`, 503 si Veterinary no responde.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', body.token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Cerrar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Invalida el access token actual (blacklist en Redis). Si el body trae `refreshToken`, tambien lo revoca. Requiere `Authorization: Bearer` (override de carpeta, que es No Auth).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Llave pública (JWKS)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/.well-known/jwks.json",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ".well-known",
                "jwks.json"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Publica la llave publica RSA activa (JWKS) para validar los JWT. Publico, sin JWT."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Registro",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/user/register",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registro de usuario local + envio de codigo de verificacion. Publico. `fullName` y `phone` son opcionales (ver docs/NOMBRE_Y_TELEFONO.md). `phone` se normaliza a E.164.\n\nErrores: 409 email/username ya existen, 400 datos invalidos (incluye `INVALID_PHONE`).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"luis_santiago_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"email\": \"luis.santiago.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123!\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Luis Santiago\",\n  \"phone\": \"3001234567\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('user_id', body.uuid);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {},
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"uuid\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n  \"username\": \"luis_santiago_1234\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Luis Santiago\",\n  \"phone\": \"+573001234567\",\n  \"email\": \"luis.santiago.1234@example.com\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-26T10:00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar usuario - username con espacios (error esperado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/user/register",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El username sigue sin admitir espacios (regla sin cambios). Espera 400 con el mapa de errores de campo (`username`).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"Luis Santiago\",\n  \"email\": \"error.username.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('Error de username', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(JSON.stringify(body)).to.include('username');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar usuario - fullName con < > (error esperado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/user/register",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`fullName` rechaza `<` y `>` (FullNamePolicy). Espera 400 (`InvalidUserDataException`).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"usuario_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"email\": \"error.fullname.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123!\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Luis <script>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Registrar usuario - phone inválido (error esperado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{user_url}}/user/register",
              "host": [
                "{{user_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "user",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "`phone` invalido (PhoneNumberPolicy + libphonenumber). Espera 400 con `code: INVALID_PHONE`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"usuario_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"email\": \"error.phone.{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secreta123!\",\n  \"phone\": \"not-a-phone\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('code INVALID_PHONE', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('INVALID_PHONE');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 INVALID_PHONE",
              "originalRequest": {},
              "status": "Error",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Invalid phone number\",\n  \"code\": \"INVALID_PHONE\",\n  \"status\": 400\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      }
    },
